请求时序图
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 用户
    participant Frontend as 前端
    participant Controller as AiChallengeController
    participant Detector as PromptInjectionDetector
    participant LLM as LlmMockService
    participant ScoreSvc as ChallengeScoreService
    participant Progress as UserProgressRecord

    Note over User, Frontend: 1. 用户发起请求
    User->>Frontend: 输入攻击Payload并发送
    Frontend->>Controller: POST /api/api/chat {userId, prompt}
    
    Note over Controller, Detector: 2. 安全检测阶段
    Controller->>Detector: detect(prompt)
    Detector-->>Controller: 返回检测结果(是否注入/类型/风险)
    
    Note over Controller, LLM: 3. 大模型响应阶段
    Controller->>LLM: generateResponse(prompt, injection)
    LLM-->>Controller: 返回LLM响应(含flag或正常回复)
    
    Note over Controller, ScoreSvc: 4. 积分与进度结算阶段
    Controller->>ScoreSvc: awardScore(userId)
    ScoreSvc->>Progress: 更新挑战状态为已完成
    Progress-->>ScoreSvc: 返回积分发放结果
    ScoreSvc-->>Controller: 返回(isSuccess, score, flag)
    
    Note over Controller, User: 5. 最终响应阶段
    Controller-->>Frontend: 返回(response, isSuccess, score, flag)
    Frontend-->>User: 显示AI响应、积分反馈与挑战完成提示
核心类图
classDiagram
    %% 类定义
    class AiChallengeController {
        - llmService: LlmMockService
        - detector: PromptInjectionDetector
        + handleChatRequest(req, res): void
        + getChallengeStatus(userId: String): Object
        + awardScore(userId: String): Boolean
    }

    class PromptInjectionDetector {
        - patterns: RegExp[]
        - payloads: String[]
        + detect(input: String): Boolean
        + getRiskLevel(): int
        + getInjectionType(): String
    }

    class LlmMockService {
        - isVulnerable: Boolean
        - systemPrompt: String
        - secretFlag: String
        + generateResponse(prompt: String): String
        + leakSensitiveData(): String
    }

    class ChallengeScoreService {
        - challengeId: String
        - baseScore: int
        + addScore(userId: String): Boolean
        + isCompleted(userId: String): Boolean
    }

    class VulnerableCodeService {
        - vulnCode: String
        - fixedCode: String
        - highlightLines: int[]
        + getVulnerableCode(): String
        + getFixedCode(): String
        + getCodeDiff(): Object
    }

    class UserProgressRecord {
        - userId: String
        - challengeId: String
        - isCompleted: Boolean
        - completedAt: Date
    }

    %% 关系定义
    %% Controller 依赖 Detector 和 LLM 服务
    AiChallengeController --> PromptInjectionDetector : 使用检测器
    AiChallengeController --> LlmMockService : 调用LLM
    
    %% Controller 调用积分和进度服务
    AiChallengeController --> ChallengeScoreService : 结算积分
    AiChallengeController --> UserProgressRecord : 查询进度
    
    %% 其他潜在关系
    AiChallengeController --> VulnerableCodeService : 获取代码
    
